{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c6b7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a87b-9700-7b13-a5a9-4a460ed866b3"},"sequence":438,"recorded_at":1780531400000871,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"729941af-ea8e-4d7f-a339-63c28c483dc7","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"729941af-ea8e-4d7f-a339-63c28c483dc7","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"729941af-ea8e-4d7f-a339-63c28c483dc7"},"call_id":"call_01a0a87cfa4a74d69dd8070a950a9b70","text":"Read text file `.spec/runner-registration.md`.\n1|# Runner registration (in scope for this release)\n2|\n3|Promoted from §2 \"next stage\" into this release. Implemented by\n4|TASK-260916-13diw4; this slice provides login + installation/repo selection\n5|that the wizard consumes.\n6|\n7|## Scope\n8|\n9|- Wizard downloads the architecture-matched official runner, verifies\n10|  integrity, installs to a no-space path, obtains a scoped short-lived\n11|  registration token, runs exact `config.sh` invocation, sets up\n12|  `runsvc.sh` + manual LaunchAgent, retries idempotently with recovery.\n13|- Org registration uses a dedicated per-Mac group + selected repo access;\n14|  personal repos get separate installations. Repo access and labels remain\n15|  editable; real IDs are fetched; permission errors are retained.\n16|- Never mutates unrelated/shared groups without explicit UI scope.\n17|\n18|## Preconditions (this slice)\n19|\n20|- `GitHubAuth` connected with installations + selected repos.\n21|- Required elevation (later): Self-hosted runners/write (org) or\n22|  Administration/write (repo) + matching user rights. Absence blocks the\n23|  wizard step with the concrete missing permission, not a generic error.\n24|\n25|## Safety\n26|\n27|- No auto-transfer of a running runner; relocation is a separate stopped\n28|  operation with restore.\n29|- No second controlling process; validate manifest + `.runner` + binaries +\n30|  no-space paths immediately before action.\n31|- Registration tokens are short-lived, Keychain-only, never logged.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
