sic) need the admin:org scope to use this endpoint.\\n623-\\n624-### Parameters\\n625-\\n626-#### Headers\\n627-\\n====RUNNERS====\\n701:## Set custom labels for a self-hosted runner for an organization\\n702-\\n703-```\\n704-PUT /orgs/{org}/actions/runners/{runner_id}/labels\\n705-```\\n706-\\n707:Remove all previous custom labels and set the new custom labels for a specific\\n708-self-hosted runner configured in an organization.\\n709-Authenticated users must have admin access to the organization to use this endpoint.\\n710-OAuth app tokens and personal access tokens (classic) need the admin:org scope to use this endpoint. If the repository is private, the repo scope is also required.\\n711-\\n712-### Parameters\\n713-\\n714-#### Headers\\n715-\\n--\\n762:## Remove all custom labels from a self-hosted runner for an organization\\n763-\\n764-```\\n765-DELETE /orgs/{org}/actions/runners/{runner_id}/labels\\n766-```\\n767-\\n768:Remove all custom labels from a self-hosted runner configured in an\\n769-organization. Returns the remaining read-only labels from the runner.\\n770-Authenticated users must have admin access to the organization to use this endpoint.\\n771-OAuth app tokens and personal access tokens (classic) need the admin:org scope to use this endpoint. If the repository is private, the repo scope is also required.\\n772-\\n773-### Parameters\\n774-\\n775-#### Headers\\n776-\\n--\\n810:## Remove a custom label from a self-hosted runner for an organization\\n811-\\n812-```\\n813-DELETE /orgs/{org}/actions/runners/{runner_id}/labels/{name}\\n814-```\\n815-\\n816:Remove a custom label from a self-hosted runner configured\\n817-in an organization. Returns the remaining labels from the runner.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2131,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 533,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
